{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34309","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 三 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倭僧留海纸，山匠制云牀。\n嬾外应无敌，贫中直是王。\n池平鸥思喜，花尽蝶情忙。\n欲问新秋计，菱丝一亩强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}